        "description": "XC6206 LDO regulator converts the external USB-derived VIN_5V rail into the internal VCC_3V3 logic rail for downstream circuitry. This module is the sole provider of VCC_3V3 and serves as the internal 3.3V power distribution source. U2 uses VIN as input, VOUT as the generated rail, and VSS to system ground. No separate enable or mode control pins are present in the provided component data, so the regulator is planned as always active whenever VIN_5V is present.",
